  "title": "Why Single-Vendor AI Dependence Is Becoming a Serious Risk",
  "summary": "When access restrictions appeared at Anthropic it looked like an isolated incident, but similar approval bottlenecks are now emerging at OpenAI as well, and a pattern is harder to dismiss than an anomaly. Any organization that has built production workflows around a single external AI vendor has not made a technical choice, it has accepted an operational dependency it does not control.",
